{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁנָה²","hw":"שְׁנָה²","html":"† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. year (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁנָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁנָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">שָׁנָה</a>, √ <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁנָה\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁנָה\", dir=\"rtl\">I.</a> [<a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁנָה\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁנָה\", dir=\"rtl\">שָׁנָה</a>]<strong>)</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת</span>: <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ חֲדָה</span> = <em>first year</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:13\" href=\"/Ezra.5.13\">Ezr 5:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:3\" href=\"/Ezra.6.3\">6:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:1\" href=\"/Daniel.7.1\">Dn 7:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ תַּרְתֵּין</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:24\" href=\"/Ezra.4.24\">Ezr 4:24</a> <em>second year;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ שֵׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:15\" href=\"/Daniel.6.15\">6:15</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנִין שִׁתִּין וְת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:1\" href=\"/Daniel.6.1\">Dn 6:1</a> <em>62 years;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ שַׂגִּיאָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:11\" href=\"/Ezra.5.11\">Ezr 5:11</a>.—ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">[שְׁנָה]</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, ישׁן\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_ישׁן\", dir=\"rtl\">ישׁן</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, שׁנן","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁנָא"}